<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak cbank forex reserves dip to $2.9bln-June 11.</title>
<headline>Slovak cbank forex reserves dip to $2.9bln-June 11.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $2.929 billion as of June 11, down from $3.076 billion on May 28.  </p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES     June 11     May 28    Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)	 2.929	 3.076	3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	    2.114	 2.028	2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector     5.043	 5.104	 5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
